  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "It is one of the fastest Immortal Gu Houses in Southern Border, even faster than the upper extreme heavenly eagle, so an escape that relied only on the eagle would be caught sooner or later. Its unique method uses earth path dao marks to reduce immortal essence expenditure and raise speed, and in Southern Border’s dense mountain forests it moves like a fish in water. At full speed it is like rumbling sand, with yellow-brown sand moving inside and dust clouds surging outside. The Gu Immortals inside are not only from Hou clan: rank eight Shang Wu Jie of Shang clan is also aboard, and Hou clan would not have given Yao clan, Luo clan, or even Tie clan that face.",
      "chapters": [
        1386
      ],
