      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Southern Border’s rank seven Gu Immortals face Heavenly Court’s main force, Unfixed Manor, Flying Sand Pavilion, and Bay Pavilion are taken out and those rank sevens quickly enter them.",
